        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Wastewater Service Only Commercial User &ndash; In City &ndash; capital consumption charge (over forty eight units) (per hundred cubic feet)</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:69.75pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$0.4700</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:213.35pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Wastewater Service Only Commercial User &ndash; Minimum Capital Charge &ndash; Outside City (includes first twenty eight units)</span></span></p>
        			</td>
